{"id":"gue_re","lemma":"guère","pos":"adv","rank":3011,"glosses":["hardly, barely, (not) much"],"ipa":"/ɡɛʁ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/5c/Fr-gu%C3%A8re.ogg/Fr-gu%C3%A8re.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Il ne travaille guère.","en":"He hardly works.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to work","l":"travailler"},null]},{"text":"Je ne vois guère de choix.","en":"I don't see much choice.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to see","l":"voir"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[4,6,"of choice"]]},{"text":"Ils n'avaient guère à manger.","en":"They did not have much food to eat.","words":[{"g":"they"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},null,{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"to eat"}]},{"text":"Ça ne prend guère de temps.","en":"It doesn't take very long.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/70368","words":[{"g":"that"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to take","l":"prendre"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"time"}]},{"text":"Apparemment, guère n'a changé.","en":"Apparently, not much has changed.","words":[{"g":"apparently"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to exchange","l":"changer"}]}]}